      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We discuss the latest findings regarding the therapy of acute herpes zoster and postherpetic neuralgia. Aside from the conventional modes of treatment. We especially refer to the therapy with aciclovir. In addition, we present the techniques of transcutaneous electrostimulation and neurosurgery."},
